Solver: Gurobi (gurobipy)
- Import: `import gurobipy as gp` and `from gurobipy import GRB`
- Create model: `model = gp.Model()`
- Variable types: `GRB.CONTINUOUS`, `GRB.INTEGER`, `GRB.BINARY`
- Add constraint: `model.addConstr(...)`
- Set objective: `model.setObjective(..., GRB.MINIMIZE)` or `GRB.MAXIMIZE`
- Solve: `model.optimize()`
- Check status: `model.status == GRB.OPTIMAL`
- Get objective value: `model.ObjVal`
